cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: qcx
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Makowski
    given-names: Marcin
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/myamlak/bladawiec"
abstract: >-
  A C++23 quantum-chemistry framework: Gaussian basis sets, one- and
  two-electron integral engines, symmetry detection, DFT integration grids,
  self-consistent field solvers, checkpointed storage and derived
  properties, organized as a dependency-enforced module DAG. The published
  work its algorithms, kernels and vendored data derive from is listed in
  CITATION.bib.
